# Swasthya — root .gitignore
# MASTER_RULES.md §29 (secrets) and §28 (environments): local credentials and
# tooling are NEVER committed. This file guards the repository root; the
# Laravel scaffold in backend/ carries its own .gitignore (vendor, .env, etc.).

# Project-local portable toolchain (PHP, Composer, PostgreSQL binaries, the
# dev database cluster, and its local password file) — development tooling,
# not source. Reproduce via the run doc / DEVELOPMENT_LOG, never from git.
/.toolchain/

# Agent workspace (thread state, previews) — tooling, not project code.
/.freebuff/

# Local environment files anywhere in the tree (defense in depth; the
# backend/.gitignore already ignores backend/.env).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.staging.example
!.env.testing.example

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
